WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:10.773
A blue-gloved hand reaches toward a panel beside a lit plant growth chamber filled with green plants. Equipment panels and cables line the walls of the space station module.

2
00:00:35.973 --> 00:00:49.638
The gray-haired astronaut in a black shirt and blue gloves turns to the chamber and tends the plants with both hands, adjusting foliage. He then steps back briefly. He returns and reaches in again to tend the plants.

3
00:00:53.938 --> 00:01:04.898
The gray-haired astronaut in a black shirt and blue gloves reaches into the growth chamber, adjusting the green plants. He works carefully among the foliage and surrounding cables.

4
00:01:30.598 --> 00:01:39.828
He repeatedly withdraws and reinserts both hands, carefully arranging the plants each time. The chamber and surrounding cables stay in view.

5
00:01:41.928 --> 00:01:50.229
The astronaut keeps both hands inside the chamber, carefully arranging the green plants. He works steadily among the cables and paneling.

6
00:02:22.829 --> 00:02:35.193
Four astronauts gather in a module with equipment racks and a laptop. They pass the pepper hand to hand, smiling and laughing. The blue-shirted astronaut hands it to the dark-shirted astronaut, who holds it up.

7
00:02:49.993 --> 00:02:57.261
The dark-shirted astronaut holds the pepper while the green-shirted astronaut reaches for it. A crewmate continues filming the group.

8
00:03:06.961 --> 00:03:18.235
At a table with a green cutting board, the black-shirted astronaut holds the pepper. The green-shirted astronaut reaches across the table toward it. The blue-shirted astronaut touches the board nearby.
